  (text "CONNECTORS" (at 747.32 22.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "13afcd73-bd97-472b-ba28-c0cb94b0276b"))
  (text "SONAR POD v1.0 (58x53 mm; v0.9 + three drive options on one board) - label-style schematic generated from design.py; nets connect by global label name. '(direct)' / '(xfmr)' after a value = link fitted only in that build." (at 20.00 285.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "00227861-ce94-43e4-abed-be3c98ec4681"))
  (text "20 V <-> 33 V: firmware (IO10 VDRV_EXT high = Q3 feeds VDRV from VDBL through D10; low = the TUSS4470's own regulator). Direct <-> transformer: 0R links. DIRECT: R40, R41, R52, R56 fitted. XFMR: R42, R43, R46, R48, R51, R53, R54, R59 fitted. Never both sets." (at 20.00 289.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "61d655f5-f808-4de9-8cb8-e922c3a2c073"))
  (text "Every board carries T1, Q1, C44, C49, C43, D7, R8B/R8C, R44/R45. xfmr firmware: drive 1, vdrv 8, IO10 low (the firmware reads the R59 strap on IO11 and refuses the 30 V switch). R49, D8 not fitted anywhere." (at 20.00 293.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9d6f68de-c2d7-457f-b9c5-165963dbbaf8"))
  (text "VERIFY BEFORE ORDER: U2 footprint DSJ0014A (self-drawn), T1 EP6 land pattern (TDK IND1867-Q) and pin 1, Q1 pinout, Q3 / Q4 / D10 SOT-23 pinouts, D9A / D9B cathodes, JST pin 1 orientation, D1/D4/D5 polarity, C49 polarity." (at 20.00 297.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fe7f61d0-d4f1-4bc1-92e4-b8e33a41f2ef"))
